This package bundles third-party source code:

- src/rust/vendor.tar.xz contains the Rust crate 'datasus-core' (MIT license,
  see inst/AUTHORS).

- The module src/blast.rs of that crate is a Rust port of blast.c 1.3 from
  zlib contrib/blast, authored by Mark Adler and distributed under the zlib
  license. It is used to decompress PKWare Data Compression Library (DCL)
  streams, which are used by DATASUS DBC files.

The original notice is preserved at the top of the ported source file, which
is marked there as an altered version.
